{
  "dialogues": [
    {
      "id": 1001,
      "characterId": 0,
      "characterName": "旁白",
      "text": "开学第一天，阳光明媚。你背着行李走在陌生的校园里，心里有些紧张。四周都是不认识的面孔，走廊里充满了声音。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [{"choiceId": 1, "text": "继续", "nextDialogueId": 1002, "favorabilityChanges": []}]
    },
    {
      "id": 1002,
      "characterId": 0,
      "characterName": "旁白",
      "text": "走廊的转角处，你迷路了，不知道教室在哪里。你站在原地看着手里的地图，越看越迷糊。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [{"choiceId": 1, "text": "继续", "nextDialogueId": 1003, "favorabilityChanges": []}]
    },
    {
      "id": 1003,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "你好，是新来的同学吧？看起来有点迷路了，需要帮忙吗？",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "你好！太好了，我正找不到教室。（礼貌）", "nextDialogueId": 1004, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 5}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "嗯，我自己能找到。（冷淡）", "nextDialogueId": 1005, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": -2}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1004,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "哈哈，别紧张。我是学生会的林晨西，这个学校我很熟，带你去吧。顺便问一下，你叫什么名字？",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "我叫……谢谢你林学长！", "nextDialogueId": 1006, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 3}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "你不用这么麻烦的，告诉我方向就好。", "nextDialogueId": 1007, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 0}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1005,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "……好吧。不过这里挺复杂的，如果真的找不到，可以来找我，我在学生会办公室。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "……谢谢。", "nextDialogueId": 1006, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 1}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1006,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "（边走边说）你从哪里转来的？第一天来感觉怎么样，紧张吗？",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "有点紧张，这里和我之前的学校差好多。", "nextDialogueId": 1008, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 3}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "还好，就是路不太熟。", "nextDialogueId": 1008, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 1}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1007,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "没关系，我顺路的。（他还是陪你走到了教室门口，温柔地指了指门牌）到了，就是这里。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "……谢谢你。", "nextDialogueId": 1008, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 2}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1008,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "第一天嘛，都会这样的。我刚来的时候连食堂都找不到，饿了一个上午。（他笑着摇摇头）",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "哈哈，学长你也会这样啊！（笑出来）", "nextDialogueId": 1009, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 4}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "……真的吗？（没忍住笑）", "nextDialogueId": 1009, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 2}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1009,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "到了，就是这里。（在教室门口停下）有什么不懂的随时来找我，学生会就在三楼。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "嗯！谢谢学长，以后麻烦你了。", "nextDialogueId": 1010, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 3}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "好，谢谢。", "nextDialogueId": 1010, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 1}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1010,
      "characterId": 0,
      "characterName": "旁白",
      "text": "林晨西离开后，你看着他的背影，莫名觉得心里暖了一下。这个学校，也许没有想象中那么难融入。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [{"choiceId": 1, "text": "继续", "nextDialogueId": 1011, "favorabilityChanges": []}]
    },
    {
      "id": 1011,
      "characterId": 0,
      "characterName": "旁白",
      "text": "三天后，课间休息。你在走廊边发呆，脑子里还在想老师布置的作业，忽然有人在你肩膀上轻拍了一下。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [{"choiceId": 1, "text": "继续", "nextDialogueId": 1012, "favorabilityChanges": []}]
    },
    {
      "id": 1012,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "嘿，在想什么呢？叫你好几声了。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "啊，学长！抱歉，我在想作业的事。", "nextDialogueId": 1013, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 2}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "没什么，就是发呆。（有点不好意思）", "nextDialogueId": 1013, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 1}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1013,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "哪门课的作业？我在这里待了两年，也许能帮上你。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "是文学鉴赏，我对古文不太擅长……", "nextDialogueId": 1014, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 3}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "不用了，我能自己搞定的。", "nextDialogueId": 1015, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": -1}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1014,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "古文啊，那正好是我的强项。放学后图书馆见？我把我当时的笔记带给你。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "真的吗！学长你太好了！", "nextDialogueId": 1016, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 5}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "……好，谢谢学长。", "nextDialogueId": 1016, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 2}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1015,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "（他没有勉强，只是微笑）好，那我把我当时的笔记放在图书馆三楼，可以去借阅参考。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "……谢谢学长。", "nextDialogueId": 1016, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 2}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1016,
      "characterId": 0,
      "characterName": "旁白",
      "text": "图书馆里，林晨西的笔记写得极为工整，注释也非常详细。你一边翻看，一边忍不住想，这个人做什么都这么认真。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Library",
      "choices": [{"choiceId": 1, "text": "继续", "nextDialogueId": 1017, "favorabilityChanges": []}]
    },
    {
      "id": 1017,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "怎么样，看得懂吗？这里有几个意象比较难，我给你解释一下。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Library",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "学长，你的笔记也太好看了……是真的好看。", "nextDialogueId": 1018, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 5}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "嗯，大部分能看懂，有几处想请教你。", "nextDialogueId": 1018, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 3}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1018,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "（轻轻笑了）你过奖了。其实我小时候很不喜欢语文，后来慢慢发现文字里有很多有意思的东西。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Library",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "学长还有不喜欢的科目？感觉你什么都很厉害。", "nextDialogueId": 1019, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 4}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "是吗……我也想找到这种感觉。", "nextDialogueId": 1019, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 3}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1019,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "哪里，我数学一塌糊涂。（他苦笑）你别看我在学生会，其实我只是不善于拒绝别人……被拉进来的。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Library",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "哈哈！学长你这样说好可爱。", "nextDialogueId": 1020, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 5}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "……原来如此，我以为你很享受呢。", "nextDialogueId": 1020, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 2}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1020,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "（耳根微红）可……可爱？你是第一个这样说我的。（清了清嗓子）好了，继续看笔记。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Library",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "（忍住笑）好好好，我看。", "nextDialogueId": 1021, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 3}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1021,
      "characterId": 0,
      "characterName": "旁白",
      "text": "又过了一周。文化节筹备开始，班主任点名让你负责班级的展览策划，你完全没有头绪。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [{"choiceId": 1, "text": "继续", "nextDialogueId": 1022, "favorabilityChanges": []}]
    },
    {
      "id": 1022,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "（在走廊碰到你）怎么了，看起来愁眉苦脸的？",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "学长，我被安排策划文化节，完全不知道从哪里开始……", "nextDialogueId": 1023, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 3}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "没事，就是有点累。", "nextDialogueId": 1024, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 0}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1023,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "文化节策划啊，我去年负责过整体统筹。要不要一起来？两个人总比一个人好。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "真的吗？学长你愿意帮我！太好了！", "nextDialogueId": 1025, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 5}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "这样会不会耽误你的时间……", "nextDialogueId": 1026, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 2}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1024,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "（看穿你）……是文化节策划的事吧？我听班主任提起过。如果需要帮忙，我在。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "学长……你怎么知道。（哭笑不得）好吧，求你了。", "nextDialogueId": 1025, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 4}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1025,
      "characterId": 0,
      "characterName": "旁白",
      "text": "就这样，你们开始一起在图书馆规划文化节展览。林晨西提出了很多有创意的想法，你负责整理和补充细节，配合出奇地默契。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Library",
      "choices": [{"choiceId": 1, "text": "继续", "nextDialogueId": 1027, "favorabilityChanges": []}]
    },
    {
      "id": 1026,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "不会的，我最近学生会事情不多。而且……（顿了顿）和你一起做事，感觉挺好的。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "（心跳了一下）……好，那就麻烦你了，学长。", "nextDialogueId": 1025, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 5}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1027,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "对了，我想在展览加一个摄影区，用镜头记录同学们的日常。你觉得怎么样？",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Library",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "好主意！学长你会摄影吗？", "nextDialogueId": 1028, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 3}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "嗯，这样会有人情味，我喜欢。", "nextDialogueId": 1028, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 3}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1028,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "算是吧，从初中开始学的。最喜欢拍傍晚的光影，那个时候光线很柔和……（他有点不好意思）说多了。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Library",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "没有，我想多听。学长可以给我看看你拍的照片吗？", "nextDialogueId": 1029, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 5}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "光影……感觉学长很有艺术感。", "nextDialogueId": 1029, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 3}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1029,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "（掏出手机，递给你）这些是最近拍的，都是校园里的……（有点期待地看着你）",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Library",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "好漂亮。学长你真的拍得很好。", "nextDialogueId": 1030, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 6}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "嗯，构图很好，很有感觉。", "nextDialogueId": 1030, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 4}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1030,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "（眼睛亮了一下）真的吗？其实……有一张是你。（翻到一张在走廊发呆的照片）那天你在发呆，光刚好打在你脸上，我没忍住就拍了。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Library",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "（脸红）学长！你偷拍我！", "nextDialogueId": 1031, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 5}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "（看着那张照片，不说话，心里有点奇怪的感觉）", "nextDialogueId": 1031, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 4}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1031,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "（也有点红）对不起……我可以删掉，只是觉得……那一刻很好看。（低下头）",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Library",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "……不用删。（轻声说）", "nextDialogueId": 1032, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 8}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "下次先问我好不好……（但没让他删）", "nextDialogueId": 1032, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 4}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1032,
      "characterId": 0,
      "characterName": "旁白",
      "text": "那个傍晚，图书馆里安静得只有翻页的声音。你们谁也没有再提那张照片，但气氛悄悄变得不一样了。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Library",
      "choices": [{"choiceId": 1, "text": "继续", "nextDialogueId": 1033, "favorabilityChanges": []}]
    },
    {
      "id": 1033,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "（收拾东西准备走，忽然说）天黑了，一起走吧。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Library",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "好啊。（心里有点开心）", "nextDialogueId": 1034, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 3}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "嗯……（默默收拾包）", "nextDialogueId": 1034, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 2}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1034,
      "characterId": 0,
      "characterName": "旁白",
      "text": "回去的路上，林晨西和你聊了很多。他说他喜欢下雨天，喜欢在傍晚骑车，喜欢看纪录片。你发现他其实是个非常细腻的人，只是平时不轻易表露。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [{"choiceId": 1, "text": "继续", "nextDialogueId": 1035, "favorabilityChanges": []}]
    },
    {
      "id": 1035,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "你呢，平时喜欢做什么？",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "我喜欢听音乐，还有发呆……（有点不好意思）", "nextDialogueId": 1036, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 4}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "没什么特别的爱好，就是随便逛逛。", "nextDialogueId": 1036, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 2}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1036,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "发呆也是一种爱好。（他认真地说）我拍过很多发呆的人，那个状态最真实。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "所以你也拍过我是因为……（看向他）", "nextDialogueId": 1037, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 5}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "……你这样说，我倒觉得发呆也没那么丢人了。", "nextDialogueId": 1037, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 3}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1037,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "（停下脚步，轻声）……因为你看起来，有很多心事，但还是在努力适应这里。我觉得……很好看。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "（心跳漏了一拍，低下头）学长……", "nextDialogueId": 1038, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 6}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "（说不出话，只是看着他）", "nextDialogueId": 1038, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 4}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1038,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "（也有点不自然地移开视线）……到宿舍楼了，进去吧。晚安。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/School",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "……晚安，学长。（站在原地看着他离开）", "nextDialogueId": 1039, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 3}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1039,
      "characterId": 0,
      "characterName": "旁白",
      "text": "文化节前一天，你们在教室布置展览到很晚。等其他同学都走了，只剩下你和林晨西还在收拾最后的细节。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Festival",
      "choices": [{"choiceId": 1, "text": "继续", "nextDialogueId": 1040, "favorabilityChanges": []}]
    },
    {
      "id": 1040,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "好了，最后一块展板挂好了。（退后一步，看着整个展览）……还不错吧？",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Festival",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "不错？是很好吧！学长你太谦虚了。", "nextDialogueId": 1041, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 3}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "嗯……（看着那些照片，其中有一张你的）很有感觉。", "nextDialogueId": 1041, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 3}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1041,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "（看向你）你知道吗，最开始我加那个摄影区，有一部分原因是……想把你拍的那张放进去。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Festival",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "……为什么？（心跳莫名加速）", "nextDialogueId": 1042, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 4}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "（沉默，不知道说什么）", "nextDialogueId": 1042, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 3}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1042,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "因为……你来这里以后，我每天都有很多理由想见到你。帮你找教室，借你笔记，一起做策划。（停顿）我自己也没意识到，直到有一天发现，我一整天都在想今天能不能遇见你。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Festival",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "（心跳得很快，小声）……学长。", "nextDialogueId": 1043, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 5}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "（不知道该怎么回应）", "nextDialogueId": 1043, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 3}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1043,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "我喜欢你。（他直视着你，声音很平静，但眼神很认真）不用现在回答，我等你。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Festival",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "我……我也是。我也喜欢你，林晨西。", "nextDialogueId": 1044, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 10}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "学长，我需要一点时间……", "nextDialogueId": 1045, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 3}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1044,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "（愣了一下，随即笑了——那是你见过他最温柔的笑）……谢谢你。（轻声）以后，我会好好的。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Festival",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "（心里很暖，点点头）嗯。（第一次叫他名字）林晨西。", "nextDialogueId": 1046, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 8}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1045,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "嗯，我知道。（他温柔地笑）不管结果如何，我们还是朋友。我不会让你为难的。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Festival",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "学长……谢谢你理解我。", "nextDialogueId": 1046, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 5}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1046,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "（怔了一下，然后笑得很轻柔）……你叫我名字了。（停顿）以后，也这样叫我吧。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Festival",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "嗯。（点头，心里有什么东西落定了）", "nextDialogueId": 1047, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 5}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1047,
      "characterId": 0,
      "characterName": "旁白",
      "text": "文化节当天，展览大获好评。同学们纷纷在摄影墙前驻足，林晨西的照片让很多人感动。而那张你在走廊发呆的照片，被贴在了展览的正中央。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Festival",
      "choices": [{"choiceId": 1, "text": "继续", "nextDialogueId": 1048, "favorabilityChanges": []}]
    },
    {
      "id": 1048,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "（人群散去后，悄悄走到你身边）累了吗？（递给你一罐冰凉的饮料）辛苦了。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Festival",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "有一点，但很值得。（接过饮料，微笑）", "nextDialogueId": 1049, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 3}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "谢谢……（看了他一眼）你也辛苦了。", "nextDialogueId": 1049, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 4}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1049,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "（一起看着展览的照片墙，轻声）我很高兴，是和你一起做的这件事。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Festival",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "我也是。以后……还可以一起做很多事吧。", "nextDialogueId": 1050, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 6}]},
        {"choiceId": 2, "text": "嗯……（静静地站在他旁边）", "nextDialogueId": 1050, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 3}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1050,
      "characterId": 1,
      "characterName": "林晨西",
      "text": "（看向你，眼神很温柔）嗯。以后，还有很多个这样的傍晚。（停顿，轻轻笑）我们慢慢来。",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Festival",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "（心里很暖）……嗯，慢慢来。", "nextDialogueId": 1051, "favorabilityChanges": [{"characterId": 1, "change": 5}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1051,
      "characterId": 0,
      "characterName": "旁白",
      "text": "夜风轻轻吹过，文化节的彩灯还亮着，照片墙上定格着无数个普通的瞬间。而你知道，有些瞬间，从此不再普通。\n\n——林晨西篇章完——",
      "backgroundPath": "Backgrounds/Festival",
      "choices": [
        {"choiceId": 1, "text": "完成", "nextDialogueId": -1, "favorabilityChanges": []}
      ]
    }
